<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54476" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταμαρτῠρέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bear witness against</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινος</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Antipho
				2.4.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				19.120
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				29.9
			</span></i>, Mitteis <i><span class="en">
				<u>Chr.</u>
				31v33
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατά τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					28.3
				</span></i>
			, etc.: c. acc. rei, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψευδῆ κ. τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					45.46
				</span></i>
			 (Docum.), <i><span class="en">
				29.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Is.
				5.12
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
				26.62
			</span></i>: abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτὸ τὸ ψήφισμα τῆς
					βουλῆσ—μαρτυρήσει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					13.28
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>have evidence given against</i> one, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ πιστῶς καταμαρτυρηθείς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antipho
					2.4.7
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ὑπὸ τοῦ βίου τοῦ ἑαυτοῦ</span>
			<i>to be convicted</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				1.90
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, of evidence, <i>to be given against</i> one, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἃ καταμαρτυρεῖται αὐτοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Is.
					5.25
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				6.15
			</span></i>: abs., <i><span class="en">
				D.
				29.55
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>assert concerning</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδὲν κ. τῶν οὐ παρόντων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plot.
					5.5.13
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> Astrol.,
				<i>exercise malign influence over, 'aspect</i>', <i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				104.2
			</span></i>.</div>
